# Keeper Pilot Sign-Off — Day 3 Extension

**vPilotHH01FullCycle-1.0 | Canonical: `lib/features/pilot_live/presentation/keeper_live_signoff_view.dart`**

## UI Binding

| Element | Behavior |
|---------|----------|
| Day 3 gate | Blocks view when `day3MediaReviewUnlocked == false` |
| HH01 filter | Shows only `householdId == 'HH01'` observations |
| Authorization banner | "Day 3 media review authorized for HH01" |
| Sign-off action | `FullCycleService.completeDay3MediaSignoff()` |

## RPC Chain

1. `review_48hr_observations_secure` (monitor phase)
2. `seal_covenant_secure` (48hr seal)
3. `submit_live_pilot_observation_secure` (Day 3 observation)
4. `submit_pilot_feedback_secure` (Keeper media review)
5. `seal_day7_covenant_secure` (Day 7 final seal)

## Protocol Enforcement

- Protocol 2: Elder Approval — sign-off requires elder mode
- Protocol 6: Land Contextualization — Days 3–7 carry `land_context` metadata
- Protocol 12: Cultural Integrity — seasonal templates blocked until Day 7